\section*{IV. Design Distributed Scheduling Protocol}

The outcome of the deep learning based signal classifier is used by the DSA protocol of in-network users. In this section, we present a distributed scheduling protocol that makes channel access decisions to adapt to dynamics of interference sources along with channel and traffic effects.

